WEBVTT

00:00:00.025 --> 00:00:03.297
A practical selection process starts small.

00:00:03.297 --> 00:00:11.122
Test the small model, improve the prompt, add rag if the problem is missing knowledge, and test again.

00:00:11.122 --> 00:00:19.102
Move to a medium or large model only when the evaluation set shows that capability is still the limiting factor.

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:23.192
This ladder helps avoid expensive overengineering.

00:00:23.192 --> 00:00:29.695
Each step asks whether the current system already meets the requirement before adding more complexity.
